  "details": "While I was working on my world I noticed a weird bug I was only able to reproduce on my Android device, and I was unsure how to properly bebug it because I didn't had access to the logs.\n\nOn Desktop and VR, we can open the logs by pressing a certain key combination on the keyboard, this doesn't work on Android. It would be nice if we could open the logs by pressing on a button, the button doesn't always need to be shown and could for instance be shown or hidden in the VRC settings (maybe by pressing the build number a few times like Android 11 does?)",
